<title>CANADA: Forex to issue C$30 mln of debentures.</title>
<headline>Forex to issue C$30 mln of debentures.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Le Groupe Forex Inc said on Wednesday it filed a preliminary prospectus for a proposed issue of C$30 million of convertible debentures.</p>
<p>The unsecured, subordinate debentures will be convertible into Class B subordinate voting shares of the company. Proceeds will be used to reduce bank indebtedness and for working capital. Forex produces stud lumber and oriented strand board.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
